    {
      "name": "Grid.examples.md",
      "source": "src/components/Grid/Grid.examples.md",
      "markdown": "```jsx\n<Grid.Row>\n  <Grid.Col>A</Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>B</Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>C</Grid.Col>\n</Grid.Row>\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "GridCol.examples.md",
      "source": "src/components/Grid/GridCol.examples.md",
      "markdown": "```jsx\n<Grid.Row>\n  <Grid.Col>1</Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>2</Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>3</Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>4</Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>5</Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>6</Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>7</Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>8</Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>9</Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>10</Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>11</Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>12</Grid.Col>\n</Grid.Row>\n```\n\n### Column Width\n\n```jsx\n<Grid.Row>\n  <Grid.Col width={2}>1</Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col width={4}>2</Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col width={6}>3</Grid.Col>\n</Grid.Row>\n```\n\n### Responsive Column Width\n\n```jsx\n<Grid.Row>\n  <Grid.Col xl={1} lg={2} md={4} sm={6} xs={12}>\n    1\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col xl={1} lg={2} md={4} sm={6} xs={12}>\n    2\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col xl={1} lg={2} md={4} sm={6} xs={12}>\n    3\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col xl={1} lg={2} md={4} sm={6} xs={12}>\n    4\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col xl={1} lg={2} md={4} sm={6} xs={12}>\n    5\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col xl={1} lg={2} md={4} sm={6} xs={12}>\n    6\n  </Grid.Col>\n</Grid.Row>\n```\n\n### Column Offset\n\n```jsx\n<Grid.Row>\n  <Grid.Col width={6} offset={3}>\n    2\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col md={6} offsetMd={3}>\n    4\n  </Grid.Col>\n</Grid.Row>\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "GridRow.examples.md",
      "source": "src/components/Grid/GridRow.examples.md",
      "markdown": "### Row gutters\n\n```jsx\n<Grid.Row gutters=\"xs\">\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <div\n      style={{\n        width: \"100%\",\n        height: \"100%\",\n        border: \"1px grey solid\",\n      }}\n    >A</div>\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <div\n      style={{\n        width: \"100%\",\n        height: \"100%\",\n        border: \"1px grey solid\",\n      }}\n    >B</div>\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <div\n      style={{\n        width: \"100%\",\n        height: \"100%\",\n        border: \"1px grey solid\",\n      }}\n    >C</div>\n  </Grid.Col>\n</Grid.Row>\n\n<Grid.Row gutters=\"sm\">\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <div\n      style={{\n        width: \"100%\",\n        height: \"100%\",\n        border: \"1px grey solid\",\n      }}\n    >A</div>\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <div\n      style={{\n        width: \"100%\",\n        height: \"100%\",\n        border: \"1px grey solid\",\n      }}\n    >B</div>\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <div\n      style={{\n        width: \"100%\",\n        height: \"100%\",\n        border: \"1px grey solid\",\n      }}\n    >C</div>\n  </Grid.Col>\n</Grid.Row>\n<Grid.Row gutters=\"md\">\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <div\n      style={{\n        width: \"100%\",\n        height: \"100%\",\n        border: \"1px grey solid\",\n      }}\n    >A</div>\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <div\n      style={{\n        width: \"100%\",\n        height: \"100%\",\n        border: \"1px grey solid\",\n      }}\n    >B</div>\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <div\n      style={{\n        width: \"100%\",\n        height: \"100%\",\n        border: \"1px grey solid\",\n      }}\n    >C</div>\n  </Grid.Col>\n</Grid.Row>\n<Grid.Row gutters=\"lg\">\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <div\n      style={{\n        width: \"100%\",\n        height: \"100%\",\n        border: \"1px grey solid\",\n      }}\n    >A</div>\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <div\n      style={{\n        width: \"100%\",\n        height: \"100%\",\n        border: \"1px grey solid\",\n      }}\n    >B</div>\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <div\n      style={{\n        width: \"100%\",\n        height: \"100%\",\n        border: \"1px grey solid\",\n      }}\n    >C</div>\n  </Grid.Col>\n</Grid.Row>\n```\n\n### Rows of Cards\n\n```jsx\n<Grid.Row cards>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <Card title=\"Title\" body=\"A\" />\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <Card\n      title=\"Title\"\n      body={`orem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Aperiam\n  deleniti fugit incidunt.`}\n    />\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <Card title=\"Title\" body=\"C\" />\n  </Grid.Col>\n</Grid.Row>\n<Grid.Row cards deck>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <Card title=\"Title\" body=\"A\" />\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <Card\n      title=\"Title\"\n      body={`Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Aperiam\n    deleniti fugit incidunt.`}\n    />\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <Card title=\"Title\" body=\"C\" />\n  </Grid.Col>\n</Grid.Row>\n```\n\n### Row Alignment\n\n```jsx\n<Grid.Row cards alignItems=\"center\">\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <Card title=\"Title\" body=\"A\" />\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <Card\n      title=\"Title\"\n      body={`Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Aperiam\n  deleniti fugit incidunt.`}\n    />\n  </Grid.Col>\n  <Grid.Col>\n    <Card title=\"Title\" body=\"C\" />\n  </Grid.Col>\n</Grid.Row>\n```\n"
    }
